* §1 the shifted `O'_{N,m}`-coset calculus (`mkAnmFull_L_neg_one_homog`, `mkAnmFull_Tpow_homog`,
  `mkAnmFull_smul_vacuum_homog`);
* §2 `cbz_vandermonde_top`;
